<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy — Nestkeep" description="Privacy Policy for the Nestkeep iOS app.">
  <p class="eyebrow">Nestkeep</p>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="effective">Effective date: 14 July 2026</p>

  <p>Nestkeep (&ldquo;the app&rdquo;) is designed to be completely private. This policy explains, in plain terms, what the app does and does not do with information.</p>

  <h2>Summary</h2>
  <p>Nestkeep does not collect, store, or share any personal information. There is no account to create and no sign-up. The app has no server, and it does not use advertising, analytics, or tracking of any kind.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <p>None. We do not collect your name, email address, location, contacts, device identifiers, or any other personal information. We have no servers that receive your data, and we cannot identify you.</p>

  <h2>Information stored on your device</h2>
  <p>Everything you add to Nestkeep is stored only on your device: your reminders, notes, and any photos or documents you keep. This information never leaves your phone except through your own standard Apple iCloud device backup, which is controlled entirely by you and your Apple account. We have no access to it. If you delete the app, this information is removed from your device.</p>

  <h2>Photos and camera</h2>
  <p>If you add a photo to a stored item, Nestkeep accesses your camera or photo library only for that action, with your permission. Photos you add are saved locally within the app and are not uploaded anywhere. You can export a photo back to your Photos at any time.</p>

  <h2>Notifications</h2>
  <p>Nestkeep can send you local reminders on your device. These are scheduled and delivered entirely on your phone. No notification data is sent to us or to any server.</p>

  <h2>Advertising, analytics, and tracking</h2>
  <p>Nestkeep contains no advertising, no analytics, and no tracking technologies. We do not build a profile of you and we do not follow you across apps or websites.</p>

  <h2>Selling or sharing data</h2>
  <p>We do not sell, rent, or share any personal information, because we do not collect any.</p>

  <h2>Children&rsquo;s privacy</h2>
  <p>The app does not collect personal information from anyone, including children.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, we will update the effective date above and post the revised policy at this address.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>If you have any questions about this policy, contact <a href="mailto:support@mikhailnarbekov.com">support@mikhailnarbekov.com</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
